  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Runtime",
      "items": [
        "A client-only single-page app: no server code in this repo",
        "A HashRouter serves / and /projects; unknown addresses go home",
        "The only persisted state is the colour index in localStorage"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Theme",
      "items": [
        "The matrix colour and the site theme are one index, owned by ThemeProvider",
        "main.tsx applies the stored theme before React renders, then turns the fade on",
        "CSS modules read --accent tokens on html; clicking the rain changes them all"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Delivery",
      "items": [
        "Every push and pull request runs check, build and e2e",
        "Deploy needs all three and runs only on main",
